    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Henry Kee & Son are delighted to bring to the market this impressive four bedroom semi-detached home. This very well maintained property is timber framed and has an impressive B3 energy rating. Internally the house is light filled with external glass doors and large high quality windows fitted. Ground floor accommodation comprises sitting room, kitchen / dining room, utility and WC with four bedrooms (one ensuite) plus bathroom on the first floor.. To the front is a lawn plus tarmaced parking area with an enclosed private garden at the rear. There is ample space at the side to create rear vehicle access or additional living space (subject to planning permission) if desired. Located in a popular area this home enjoys both a peaceful setting while remaining convenient to all Letterkenny amenities. Viewing recommended and by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Four bedroom semi-detached home.<br><br>\nHallway - 5.40m x 2.00m <br>Tiled floor.\nPine staircase to first floor.\nCloak cupboard under stairs.\nGlass front door with three side windows.\nBlinds & curtain rails fitted.<br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 4.50m x 4.20m <br>Open fire.\nOak floor.\nBox window (2.00m x 0.60m).\nFitted blinds & curtain rail fitted.\nThree stem centre ceiling light.<br><br><br>\nKitchen/Dining Room - 6.50m x 3.80m <br>High & low level kitchen units (blue). \nStainless steel sink.\nIntegrated dishwasher.\nIntegrated fridge / freezer.\nElectric oven.\nElectric hob.\nChrome extractor fan.\nPatio doors opening onto back garden.\nPorcelain tiled floor.\nTwo centre ceiling lights.\nTwo spot lights over sink.\nWindow overlooking back garden.\nWalls tiled between units.<br><br><br>\nUtility - 2.80m x 1.70m <br>Low level kitchen units.\nStainless steel sink.\nPlumbed for washing machine & tumble dryer (not included).\nPorcelain tiled floor.\nGlass door opening onto paved outside area.<br><br><br>\nWC - 1.60m x 1.60m <br>Access from hallway.\nWHB & WC.\nPorcelain tiled floor.<br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 4.70m x 4.00m <br>Measurement includes ensuite.\nFloor carpeted.\nSouth facing box window.\nBlinds on window.\n\nEnsuite\nWHB, WC & electric shower..\nFloor tiled.\nGable window.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 4.20m x 2.90m <br>Floor carpeted.\nWindow overlooking back garden.\n<br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 3.20m x 3.00m <br>Built-in wardrobe.\nFloor carpeted.\nSouth facing window overlooking front lawn.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Four - 2.90m x 2.30m <br>Floor carpeted.\nWindow overlooking rear garden.<br><br><br>\nBathroom - 3m x 2m <br>WHB, WC & bath.\nShower (off hot tank).\nFloor tiled.\nWalls part tiled.\nGable window. <br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Built in 2008.\nTimber framed design.\nHigh quality external doors & windows fitted.\nA high standard internal finish throughout.\nPorcelain floor tiles in hall, kitchen, utility and WC.\nVery efficient B3 energy rating.\nPeaceful & very convenient location.\nPrivate back garden.\nAmple off-road parking.\nShowing low risk for MICA degradation and negligible risk in relation to Iron Sulphide degradation and good compressive strength levels."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment"
      }
    ],
